"Enter or paste the <a href=\"https://help.victorops.com/knowledge-base/api/"
"\" target=\"_blank\">VictorOps API key</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ange eller klistra in <a href=\"https://help.victorops.com/knowledge-base/"
