"Enter or paste the <a href=\"https://portal.victorops.com/public/api-"
"docs.html#/Routing32Keys\" target=\"_blank\">VictorOps routing key</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ange eller klistra in <a href=\"https://portal.victorops.com/public/api-"
"docs.html#/Routing32Keys\" target=\"_blank\">VictorOps dirigeringsnyckel</a>."

