"Enter the IP address which runs the  S3 service. <i>0.0.0.0</i> tells the "
"server to listen  on all addresses."
msgstr ""
"Ange IP-adressen som kör S3-tjänsten. <i>0.0.0.0</i> instruerar servern att "
"lyssna på alla adresser."

msgid ""
"Enter the IPv4 address for <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?"
"query=vnet\" target=\"_blank\">VNET(9)</a> and shared IP jails."
msgstr ""
"Ange IPv4-adressen för <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?"
"query=vnet\" target=\"_blank\">VNET(9)</a> och jail-miljöer med delad IP-"
"adress."

msgid ""
"Enter the IPv6 address for <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?"
"query=vnet\" target=\"_blank\">VNET(9)</a> and shared IP jails."
msgstr ""
"Ange IPv6-adressen för <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?"
"query=vnet\" target=\"_blank\">VNET(9)</a> och jail-miljöer med delad IP-"
"adress."

msgid ""
"Enter the S3 access ID. See <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/"
"latest/gr/aws-sec-cred-types.html#access-keys-and-secret-access-keys\" "
"target=\"_blank\">  Access keys</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ange S3-åtkomst-ID:t. Se <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/"
"latest/gr/aws-sec-cred-types.html#access-keys-and-secret-access-keys\" "
"target=\"_blank\">åtkomstnycklar</a> för mer information."

msgid ""
"Enter the S3 secret access key. See  <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/"
"general/latest/gr/aws-sec-cred-types.html#access-keys-and-secret-access-"
"keys\" target=\"_blank\">  Access keys</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ange den hemliga S3-åtkomstnyckeln. Se <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/"
"general/latest/gr/aws-sec-cred-types.html#access-keys-and-secret-access-"
"keys\" target=\"_blank\">åtkomstnycklar</a> för mer information."

msgid "Enter the SSH Port of the remote system."
msgstr "Ange SSH-porten för fjärrsystemet."

msgid "Enter the TCP port which provides the S3 service."
msgstr "Ange TCP-porten som tillhandahåller S3-tjänsten."

msgid "Enter the administrator password to authorize this operation."
msgstr "Ange administratörslösenordet för att auktorisera åtgärden."

msgid "Enter the bug tracker account password."
msgstr "Ange lösenordet för felrapporteringskontot."

msgid "Enter the command with any options."
msgstr "Ange kommandot med eventuella alternativ."

msgid ""
"Enter the current passphrase for the encrypted pool. This will be used to "
